  "title": "Sequans Announces Filing and Availability of 2025 Annual Report on Form 20-F",
  "summary": "PARIS, France – May 11, 2026 – Sequans Communications S.A. (NYSE: SQNS), a leading provider of 5G/4G cellular IoT semiconductor solutions, announced today that its Annual Report on Form 20-F for the year ended December 31, 2025 has been filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission (“SEC”) and is available on the Company’s website www.sequans.com […]",
